  "prefLabel": "Plc 1502.05 Contact hour",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1502.05 “Contact hour” means a unit of measure of continuing professional education that equals 60 minutes of time unless used as a time-equivalent, such as one contact hour per college credit as in Plc 1507.07(b) or 12 contact hours for passing a specialty exam as in Plc 1507.09(b).\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Plc 1500) #13496, INTERIM, eff 11-27-22; ss by #13621, eff 5-22-23 (formerly Plc 1502.05) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Plc 1500)",
